  "name": "Corn and Avocado Salsa",
  "subtitle": "A bright, chunky salsa with tender corn and creamy avocado",
  "description": "Tender corn, avocado, vegetables, herbs, and a lime-cumin dressing make a fresh salsa for dipping or serving alongside a meal.",
